 BSE|
 BSE| Excitation n           i =>/<=     a      TDA/ABBA       |X_ia^n|/|Y_ia^n|
 BSE|
 BSE|            1          46    =>    53        -ABBA-                  0.3098
 BSE|            1          48    =>    53        -ABBA-                  0.4300
